WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:02.725
(upbeat music)

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.432
Demi Lovato, the Sorry Not Sorry singer,

3
00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:09.492
clearly making no apologies for who she is

4
00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:11.507
or who she loves.

5
00:00:11.507 --> 00:00:14.265
What is it like for you to sort of open up your world?

6
00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:15.175
Scary?

7
00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:16.228
It's scary for sure.

8
00:00:16.228 --> 00:00:17.969
I talk about a lot of things

9
00:00:17.969 --> 00:00:20.610
that I haven't talked about in interviews.

10
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:21.950 line:15%
Tweeting quote,

11
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.092 line:15%
"If you're that curious about my sexuality,

12
00:00:24.092 --> 00:00:25.561 line:15%
"watch my documentary."

13
00:00:25.561 --> 00:00:27.782
Her YouTube special, Simply Complicated,

14
00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:29.552
will premier in October.

15
00:00:29.552 --> 00:00:31.852
The topic of her sexual orientation

16
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:34.251
became a source of speculation last week

17
00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:36.139
when she was photographed holding hands

18
00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:39.078
with DJ Lauren Abedini at Disneyland.

19
00:00:39.078 --> 00:00:41.781
I'm a single 25 year old woman living on her own,

20
00:00:41.781 --> 00:00:43.584
and I really feel like an adult.

21
00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.094
♫ Feelin' like a 10

22
00:00:45.094 --> 00:00:46.724
♫ The best I ever been

23
00:00:46.724 --> 00:00:48.004
I feel like I've done a lot of growing

24
00:00:48.004 --> 00:00:50.831
and my album is a result of that.

25
00:00:50.831 --> 00:00:52.789
Making no apologies for what it took

26
00:00:52.789 --> 00:00:56.531
to get to this healthy place of strength and gratitude.

27
00:00:56.531 --> 00:00:58.304
♫ Baby I'm sorry

28
00:00:58.304 --> 00:00:59.810
♫ I'm not sorry

29
00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.531
I was exclusively behind the scenes

30
00:01:01.531 --> 00:01:03.693 line:15%
of Demi's Vevo live performance.

31
00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:05.630 line:15%
It premiers September 29th,

32
00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:09.184 line:15%
the same day her new album, Tell Me You Love Me, drops.

33
00:01:09.184 --> 00:01:10.766 line:15%
There are some interesting song titles,

34
00:01:10.766 --> 00:01:13.337
and of course you released the track listing on Instagram.

35
00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:15.170
♫ You

36
00:01:18.394 --> 00:01:22.144
♫ Don't do it for me anymore

37
00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.084
So You Don't Do It For Me Anymore, as a song,

38
00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.472
for me it has a double meaning.

39
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:27.936
I'm breaking up with my old self,

40
00:01:27.936 --> 00:01:29.802
and my addiction, and my alcoholism,

41
00:01:29.802 --> 00:01:34.095
not going back to those old ways

42
00:01:34.095 --> 00:01:35.874
that I always resorted to,

43
00:01:35.874 --> 00:01:38.489
because it doesn't do it for me anymore.

44
00:01:38.489 --> 00:01:42.790
♫ Stop feeling bad for yourself

45
00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:43.990
I used to feel sorry for myself.

46
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:45.919
Now I have a different perspective on life

47
00:01:45.919 --> 00:01:48.278
where I'm feeling grateful and happy

48
00:01:48.278 --> 00:01:50.548
and I'm just in a totally different place.

49
00:01:50.548 --> 00:01:54.715 line:15%
(upbeat music)

